SUMMARY:How to Overcome Anger
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nHow t
 o Overcome Anger with Modern Buddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\nAnger
  appears in many forms and disguises. Sometimes it manifests as a feeling 
 of stress\, other times it may take the form of depression. From the sligh
 test frustration to resentment and embittered rage\, anger is an emotion w
 e all need to understand and conquer if we are to enjoy and make the most 
 out of our life. In this series we will explore practical solutions to the
  problem of anger\, deconstructing its actual causes and learning viable a
 lternatives to this painful habit of mind.\nCost: $12 (free and online opt
 ions for members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditationinashevi
 lle.org/sunday-drop-in-meditation-class/)\n[Become a Member](https://www.m
 editationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31657048
 6/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260915T190551Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915T190551Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meditation in Asheville
UID:event_316570415@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260919T042017Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T113000
SUMMARY:All In: The Power of Determinations
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nAll I
 n: The Power of Determinations with Modern Buddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon L
 ovich\n\nWhether it’s everyday stress\, sadness\, or even anger\, our su
 ffering can be transformed into inner strength\, love\, and joy. The first
  step is understanding its source. In this series\, we’ll explore Buddha
 ’s teachings on the Four Noble Truths. The Four Noble Truths are the ess
 ence of Buddhist thought and gives us a clear\, precise way to understand 
 our life and how to move forward in it. Through teachings and meditation\,
  we’ll discover that suffering comes not from external conditions\, but 
 from our own mind. Recognizing this opens the door to transforming our exp
 erience and uncovering a more lasting\, genuine happiness.\nCost: $12 (fre
 e and online options for members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.me
 ditationinasheville.org/all-in-the-power-of-determinationmini-course/)\n[B
 ecome a Member](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31657041
 5/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260915T185638Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915T185638Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
